@api = http://localhost:5000

### GET danh sach bai tap (200)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### GET chi tiet bai tap dang mo (200)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### GET bai tap khong ton tai (404 + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### POST tao luot nop hop le (201 + Location)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001-rest-api"
}

### GET doc lai luot nop vua tao (200)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### POST thieu thong tin (400 + INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### POST vao bai tap da dong (400 + ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001-rest-api"
}

### GET luot nop khong ton tai (404 + SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### POST thieu Content-Type (415)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/sv001-rest-api"
}
